================================================================================
Certified build: background task, task steps, lifecycle lock and endpoint
================================================================================

Context:
The certified build can now be started from the API. `POST
/dtwin/certified-build/start` (builder) runs `CertifiedBuild` as a
TaskManager background task on a thread-safe domain snapshot. A version
that is IN-REVIEW or PUBLISHED is refused with 409: a Certified Graph is
only built while its version is DRAFT (decision D9 of the certified-graph
SPEC).

