   - `ensure_editable`: `ConflictError` when the registry status is not
     editable (`version_lifecycle.is_editable`).
   - `task_steps`: `compose`, then `serve` (Lakehouse) or the backend load
     steps (`TwinGraphBuild.pipeline_steps`, including the managed_synced
     ones); `run()` advances from `compose` to the load step.
